<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $43-1/8 (FIM 196.02).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $43-1/8 (FIM 196.02).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed down $0-3/4 at $43-1/8 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 196.02 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia closed up one markka at 197.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed down $0-1/4 at $32-3/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 74.43 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed 0.60 lower at 74.90.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS ended flat at $21 in New York (95.45 markka). In Helsinki, Rauma closed 1.50 markka lower at 95.50.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
